{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "8ded13e7c323e5158c75195e141dfa64a36c585e85d2624c0a5e826727cf3112", "ja": "祝・ランクイン", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "78c9d1614e6a8904b8cd2e2df1694d2669a96dcf2b967694bd81f0969d1c5780", "ja": "『#プレイリスト』は大評判となり、ネトス\nワのランキングにも入る。喜ぶ一同。一方、\nライバル3人組の配信番組はひっそりと打ち\n切られていたことがわかり、プロデューサー\nはネトスワへの警戒心を強めるのだった。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9919d1c7e90438094a0ca9f60777be1beb448ce8a0ff386f05f78c1b287a5411", "ja": "（『#プレイリスト』初回放送は大評判！\nネトスワの番組を見ながら打ち上げだ！）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "09d59418af10da6493ebfa5aac7a2173763bb9cdc41a320edbd8bebdd7fec6f9", "ja": "はれっ！？　キャラメルポップコーンに、\nチュロス、もうなくなっちゃった……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9b5669e397a44d772282ab7ab11a35c87f99078920826018643949827a64ae16", "ja": "いただいたチョコバーも、もうありませんね。\nやはり意外と美味で……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "f92b5ebe0d1bcabf114c7b1a7336c5b82ab26b2b06e31b54c75c46f76605a90c", "ja": "かなり、用意したのに……\n映画2本分……保たなかった、ね……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "c1da6129a396834a427346a30fd793d0981b8c78e4b37e1f3b3c159de408f0fb", "ja": "他には何観ようか？\nランキングから探して……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "ec2830d3c74a903fd1140685a1d559f24412bd1d6dee3706fec03fc0ae256491", "ja": "あっ！　『#プレイリスト』！\n私たちの配信番組、ランキングに入ってるよ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "2435e67f4eaac5d680c5eeba68cdfe65cce8d0e11d2c20576f6df7936270d2cc", "ja": "わ、ほんとだ……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "a8b4c920b659ce17690aab49931ede1f67ec907175f94f03c7e7935210100bb3", "ja": "わあ～！　ネトスワのランキングに入るなんて、　\nやったやった～♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5e94ff9a86a464f5b31d9cc439b3818409a99e85a1808eceeaf1c98f80f94afe", "ja": "こうやって、改めて大画面で見ると\n気恥ずかしいものですね……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "e2ce592ec4870202158c752d74c1ae8f11bce1ba393bf8e212132fc6824f532a", "ja": "ん……？\nあれ、でもおかしいな～？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b711136fb56c8b45cd280082464e713f7286c97e8ee01190e4aec0de14507e0c", "ja": "？\nどうした、未来？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "e8882590a485fcdc53830abe170b32803f89266ba6baf08981071011a4fa6c1e", "ja": "あの3人の配信番組が見当たらなくて。\n前はランキング上位にいたのに……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2b999efd8be71546a6652efc931b55cb1fd7f89cebcc38743079cb6a1d6fff54", "ja": "ああ、あの配信の上手い3人組。\nちょっとスマホで調べてみるか……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1013_p", "source_sha256": "00c4a016b2766d34cdf07926eb0039e95248e9182aaef342c2f57b9637554d0a", "ja": "……えっ！？\nあの3人組の配信番組、打ち切られてるな……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "f6b93e1be1ba2521523fa4c05be5cf6291a75327e0f2239a9aa57703b62341f5", "ja": "えっ……！", "zh": "咦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
