{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d13c6ccaa622639e2b2f487055caa1707ac4c6066ee29c2e62dd3152a2ed1da3", "ja": "経営的判断として、らしい。\nそれ以外は特に理由が書いてないな……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "7b527191fc618f9fc11b6fe991e2c6f6f77e3f64cb7878ba980d3525ce721116", "ja": "す、すごい急じゃありませんか……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "67af2af42850057579450538e12f31c9c1d4106acda6129aca6f4efb5462e9ef", "ja": "ネトスワのオリジナルアイドルって\n言ってなかったっけ？　それなのに……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "772357aea1b37cc50bf96c40cd9242c710add979967a9c2dfdd99a93c4c0209e", "ja": "これからは音楽配信番組としては765プロの\n『#プレイリスト』を押していく、と。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "aa6230d0804c9f2918dcf16b8aa8663d57248a8b3ae753c949e1ddaf0d1b3bd5", "ja": "そ、それは……。私たちが勝ったとはいえ、\n素直に受け取りにくいといいますか……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "dda9be6a08fba7c2b380da8b9a7a931808632296989b9ab69923b72b00730611", "ja": "ん……。\nちょっと、不気味……かも。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "38aed9b98a8b30237b1512b9b64cdb3208396471557721d85e4cffef56149487", "ja": "そうだな……。『#プレイリスト』の数字が\nよかったとはいえ……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "37e1337491808ec4e98fbe295f55d99d2f73de80644211bd775381e0a2a11acf", "ja": "（ネットスワイプス……。\nやはり引き続き警戒は必要だな）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "74988bb543073a68d5e61e04e6b93636d33ee0ccaba01284149faef66d2fc3be", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ、{$P$}さん！\n私たち765プロは絶対、ぜーったい負けませんから！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "3bdbb876392dd8f5488a51485cd3f8ad7f456552d16d4519722e269707dab7ba", "ja": "うん！　今回みたいにみんなの力を\n合わせれば……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a0f72c64b2a50c806b14b27c5b1e70427fc66832aba4c00dce0f377d55fabedd", "ja": "はい。一丸となった765プロならば、\n怖いものは、なにも。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "64a70a45863a44447c0f01835f7b1f15a041f13788594bdf5d1e69908fe60ab7", "ja": "ん……。\n杏奈も……そう、思う。ぜったい……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "01c6e5863a250ac4a323a1ef741b1ab6b2a74c09a7d6882cb5012439e895abb8", "ja": "そうだな。『#プレイリスト』……\n次も気合いを入れて臨もう！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
